  etiket: dogc
  aciklama:
  - "Demek 2006?...\r\nO y\u0131l Nobel Edebiyat \xD6d\xFCl\xFC, Orhan Pamuk'a verilmi\u015Fti.
    Tabii ben o zamanlar hen\xFCz pek piyasada yoktum..."
  - "2006 y\u0131l\u0131 dedin de\u011Fil mi?\r\nUluslararas\u0131 Astronomi Birli\u011Fi,
    o y\u0131l Pl\xFCton'un c\xFCce gezegen oldu\u011Funa karar vermi\u015Fti. G\xF6z\xFCm\xFCzde
    b\xFCy\xFCtm\xFC\u015F\xFCz..."
  - "2006 \xF6yle mi?\r\nO y\u0131l rap sanat\xE7\u0131s\u0131 Sagopa Kajmer, kendisi
    gibi rap sanat\xE7\u0131s\u0131 olan Kolera ile evlenmi\u015Fti. \xC7ok severim...
    Sago kaf keef!"
  - "2006 m\u0131 dedin?\r\n\u015Eu ana kadarki en h\u0131zl\u0131 uzay arac\u0131,
    Pl\xFCton'a gitmek \xFCzere o y\u0131l f\u0131rlat\u0131lm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131.
    Demek ki 2006 h\u0131zl\u0131lar\u0131n y\u0131l\u0131ym\u0131\u015F..."
  - "2006 ha?\r\nO y\u0131l Google, Youtube'u sat\u0131n alm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131.
    B\xFCy\xFCk olayd\u0131 vallahi, ka\xE7\u0131rd\u0131n..."
